1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Previously on Harbor Line.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
The archive was compromised.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Mara discovered the hidden room.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The witness disappeared.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
No one knew who to trust.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Tonight, the search continues.

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
The station closes before midnight.

8
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:47,400
Then we should leave now.

9
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,000
Did you bring the map?

10
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,000
It is in the blue case.

11
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:08,000
Keep your voice down.

12
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:17,000
Someone is outside.

13
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,000
The hallway is empty.

14
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,600
Check the second door.

15
00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:44,000
This lock is new.

16
00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:54,900
Use the smaller key.

17
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:06,000
That was not here yesterday.

18
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,000
Take a picture of it.

19
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,500
The signal is gone.

20
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:44,000
We can send it from the roof.

21
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:57,800
Wait, I heard the elevator.

22
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:12,000
Hide behind the cabinet.

23
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:27,000
They passed us.

24
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:42,400
We only have ten minutes.

25
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:58,000
The stairs are blocked.

26
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:14,800
There is another route.

27
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:31,500
Follow the red cable.

28
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:49,000
The control room is ahead.

29
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:07,000
Do not touch the alarm.

30
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:25,000
I found the main switch.
